# Direct requirements of the study (Table 3.1 "Software versions"; Appendix A).
# The exact environment is environment/requirements.lock.txt, written by scripts/setup_env.sh
# with `pip freeze` on the workstation. Install that file, not this one, to reproduce runs.
#
# Python 3.10 is required: OmniSafe 0.5.0 is tested on Python 3.8-3.10 (its README; its conda
# recipe pins python = 3.10) and safety-gymnasium pins pygame 2.1.0, which has no wheel above 3.10.
# Linux is required for registered runs: OmniSafe 0.5.0 is tested on Linux (its README), and one OS
# keeps runs bit-for-bit comparable.

omnisafe==0.5.0
# What `pip install omnisafe==0.5.0` resolves on Python 3.10 (verified 2026-09-27): pip falls back
# from safety-gymnasium 1.0.0 to 0.4.1 with mujoco 2.3.0. Pinned explicitly so it cannot drift.
safety-gymnasium==0.4.1
mujoco==2.3.0
gymnasium==0.28.1
# REQUIRED: without this pin pip installs numpy 2.x, and `import omnisafe` fails because OmniSafe
# pins pandas==2.0.3, which is binary-incompatible with numpy 2 ("numpy.dtype size changed").
numpy==1.26.4
pandas==2.0.3
# Pinned explicitly (Table 3.1 names PyTorch among the pinned versions; OmniSafe requires only
# torch >= 1.10.0): the version the determinism check and tests were verified with (the PyPI
# wheel, which bundles CUDA libraries; runs use the CPU only, DEVICE = "cpu").
torch==2.14.0
# Results ledger (results/ledger_schema.py) and tests. Versions verified with tests/test_ledger_schema.py.
pyarrow==25.0.1
pydantic==2.13.5
pytest==9.1.1
# Analysis only (Part 5: Welch intervals, noncentral-t power, Spearman): analysis/ imports
# scipy; no training or evaluation code calls it. With scipy installed, `import omnisafe` also loads it
# (omnisafe/utils/plotter.py imports seaborn, whose seaborn/_statistics.py imports scipy.stats if it is
# installed and falls back to its own KDE otherwise); only OmniSafe's plotter uses seaborn, and loading
# a module draws no random number, so the pin changes no training update. Installed in the pinned
# environment on 2026-09-30.
scipy==1.15.3
